~ start
do GameDialogueManager.change_emote_color.emit(Vector4(0, 0.69, 0, 1.0), Vector4(1, 0.8, 0, 1))
do GameDialogueManager.change_emote_visibility.emit(true)
do get_parent().get_node("GameRoot/PresetRoot/SproutValley/AnimationPlayer").play("walk_in")
do wait(3)
Mayor Wiles: Ah, You must be the new farmer!
Mayor Wiles: Get ready to clear your farm for me!
- What do you mean?!
	Mayor Wiles: Did your grandpa never tell you the story?
	Mayor Wiles: A long time ago, your grandpa took out a loan from me that he never managed to repay.
	Mayor Wiles: Which means his farm is mine now!
- What are you talking about?!
	Mayor Wiles: Don't tell me your old grandpa forgot to mention it!
	Mayor Wiles: Your grandpa has fallen into debt and mortgaged his farm.
	Mayor Wiles: Since the loan went unpaid, I am now preparing to seize his farm!
Mayor Wiles: Hey, what is that envelope you are holding?
	It looks like it is from your grandpa!
	Well, go ahead and open it up.
do get_parent().get_node("GameRoot/PresetRoot/SproutValley/AnimationPlayer").play("open_envelope")
do wait(1.5)
do GameDialogueManager.change_emote_visibility.emit(false)
Envelope: Dear grandchild,
	If you're reading this, you must be in dire need of a change.
	The same thing happened to me, long ago.
Envelope: I've enclosed the deed to that place... my pride and joy.
	It's the perfect place to start your new life.
	This was my most precious gift of all, and now it's yours.
	Good luck.
	Love, Grandpa.
Envelope: P.S. I have fallen into debt and had to mortgage the farm. You have to raise 1,000 gold coins within 100 days, or we lose everything.
- GRANDPA!!!
- Why does this have to fall on me, grandpa?
do GameDialogueManager.change_emote_visibility.emit(true)
Mayor Wiles: Good luck in collecting the debt. Hahaha!
do GameManager.dialogue_finished.emit()
=> END